{"server":"tw","storyId":"act6d5_level_act6d5_st01","groupId":"act6d5","stageId":null,"title":"洪爐示歲·迎春","storyCode":"","avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act6d5/level_act6d5_st01.txt","sourceHash":"04cfce66dfef43c820d02b9e08091aa6bfea1ceb504ff5e9669b3d8c3246986b","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第一关（前）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"第一幕\n迎春"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"ac6_1"},{"type":"narration","text":"以子之矛，攻子之盾。\n以子之盾，拒子之矛。\n以子之矛，攻子之盾。\n以子之盾，拒子......拒子......\n拒子......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"......\n............\n......搞什麼啊，這不是沒完沒了嗎。\n這可怎麼辦？得想個辦法啊......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"ac6_1"},{"type":"narration","text":"以子之矛，攻子之盾......\n以子之盾，拒子之矛......\n不行，要有個“然後”。\n然後，然後......啊，有了！\n然後引發一場大爆炸，不就能全部搞定了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_rooftop_2"},{"type":"narration","text":"11:15 P.M.  天氣/晴\n除夕夜，龍門，邊防指揮中心"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"ac6_2"},{"type":"narration","text":"“14區彙報，沒有狀況。”\n“5區彙報，沒有異樣，一切正常。”\n“1區正常，沒有發現任何可疑跡象。”\n“一切正常。大家辛苦了。請繼續警惕。”\n“瞭解。”\n“明白。”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"輕浮的近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"哈欠——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"認真的近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"是你值夜班啊，現在情況如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"輕浮的近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，正按計劃進行遷移，移動速度正常，沒有發現任何異樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"輕浮的近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"唯一需要彙報的源石反應也就這些，你看看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"認真的近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"......“懷疑由源石炸藥引起的爆炸”？什麼情況？難不成在公園非法燃放煙火？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"輕浮的近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"看仔細啊，地點，地點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"認真的近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"東芳街122號倉庫，租借公司企鵝——哦，那沒事了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"認真的近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"但願今年也是平安無事的一年。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"輕浮的近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，如果真是這樣就好了。早點交班然後回家吃飯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"認真的近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"正經點，魏長官特地叮囑過，不要鬆懈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"輕浮的近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"話說回來啊，我在龍門長這麼大，每年都緊張兮兮的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"輕浮的近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"從來沒有一次真的撞見過什麼“年關”，那是怎樣的情況？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"認真的近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"我也沒見過啊。另外這個問題去年你已經問過一遍了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"輕浮的近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"不瞞你說，現在的新兵都已經認定那不過是個民間傳說了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"輕浮的近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"一個會吐火的百米巨人？要是真的有這種東西，在它離龍門還有幾十公里的時候我們就能發現，然後用護城炮解決問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"認真的近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"應該是個特別大隻的野獸，雖然一直在警備，但這種東西已經不太可能來襲擊城市了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"輕浮的近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"話是這麼說，但大家都還是好好堅守崗位的，畢竟是魏長官親自下的命令。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"認真的近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"得了，不用幫他們說話。你們在監控室裡吃泡麵的事情我已經記下了，不怪你們，年夜飯嘛，等著交紅包吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"輕浮的近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"輕浮的近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"那魏長官經歷過年關嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"認真的近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"你在質疑上司？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"輕浮的近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼會！我就是因為魏長官才加入近衛局的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"輕浮的近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，把幾乎全城的人力調來監視一個幾十年都沒有出現過的巨人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"認真的近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，魏長官向來謹慎，事事都要講個周全，你又不是不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"輕浮的近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"話是這麼說......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_383_snsant","isRemote":false,"text":"不、不好意思！我來晚了！這是上一個區間的源石監測報告！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_383_snsant","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？那個......魏長官呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"認真的近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"......呃，她不在這兒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_383_snsant","isRemote":false,"text":"欸、欸？但是陳警官告訴我她在總監控室......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"認真的近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡是屋頂......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"認真的近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"下樓左拐，最大的那間屋子是總監控室。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_383_snsant","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，我明明剛從那裡跑過來的，難道我錯過了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_383_snsant","isRemote":false,"text":"不好意思！我得趕緊過去！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"輕浮的近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼情況？那是誰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"認真的近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"新來的吧，看樣子應該是哪個技術部門的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"輕浮的近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"看她慌慌張張的，肯定第一次迎接年關，真懷念啊，我也有那樣的時候——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_3"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_383_snsant","isRemote":false,"text":"呼，呼，不好意思，請問總監控室在哪兒......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......雪雉？你怎麼還在這裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪雉","speakerId":"char_383_snsant","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？陳警官都已經到了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"應該是我問你吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_6D5_1"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_6d5_chen"},{"type":"narration","text":"陳，龍門近衛局高級警司\n歷史上最年輕的高級警司之一，雪雉的上司。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_3"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪雉","speakerId":"char_383_snsant","isRemote":false,"text":"對對對對不起！我迷路了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪雉","speakerId":"char_383_snsant","isRemote":false,"text":"這這這種重要的即時資訊沒能按時送到，我難道要被處分了......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"不至於，你初來乍到，沒帶你好好認一遍路也是我的不對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"跟我來吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪雉","speakerId":"char_383_snsant","isRemote":false,"text":"好的，呃，明白！長官！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪雉","speakerId":"char_383_snsant","isRemote":false,"text":"明明都半夜了，居然還有這麼多人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"年年如此，以防萬一。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪雉","speakerId":"char_383_snsant","isRemote":false,"text":"......以防萬一？啊，是因為年獸的傳說嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你一直待在哥倫比亞，沒見過近衛局迎接年關的景象吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪雉","speakerId":"char_383_snsant","isRemote":false,"text":"我只在小時候聽奶奶講過“年”的故事......但是太可怕了所以從來沒有把它當真過......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪雉","speakerId":"char_383_snsant","isRemote":false,"text":"渾身著火的四足怪獸潛伏在地底，人們建立城市的時候吵醒了它們，所以它們......唔！這不會是真的吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"故事，是嗎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"很多人覺得這個故事是假的，可惜，那不過是粉飾太平的自我安慰罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"龍門歷史上遭受的損失無法做假。墓碑上刻下的每一筆都無法做假。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然它已經沉寂了很多年，但我們仍需警戒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你在龍門生活過，但是回來的時間還不算長。而現在，你要補習那些過去你沒有接觸到的東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪雉","speakerId":"char_383_snsant","isRemote":false,"text":"對對對對不起！大家都這麼認真，我是不是不該這麼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，你也不用那麼緊張......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"此時此刻在這棟大樓裡的人，沒有幾位是真正目睹過年獸入侵的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"經常會有新人感到疑惑，甚至還有質疑近衛局行動的人。很正常，我習慣了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪雉","speakerId":"char_383_snsant","isRemote":false,"text":"原來如此......近衛局真是辛苦......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"向魏長官彙報完，你可以先休息一會，明早再來報到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪雉","speakerId":"char_383_snsant","isRemote":false,"text":"等等等等！呃，陳警官！那個，就是，魏長官是個什麼樣的人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪雉","speakerId":"char_383_snsant","isRemote":false,"text":"今天您突然告訴我要見她......我有點......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"在回答你之前，我覺得你應該更自信一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"是魏長官親自發函邀請你從哥倫比亞回到龍門的，你要相信自己的能力，更要相信你在接下來的任務中能夠有所作為。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"換言之，挺起胸膛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪雉","speakerId":"char_383_snsant","isRemote":false,"text":"對、對不起......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......唉。所以不要總是道歉啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你就像和我說話一樣，把你手上的所有資訊，一五一十地告訴魏長官就行了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"不要多想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪雉","speakerId":"char_383_snsant","isRemote":false,"text":"好的，我盡力，嗚......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmencommand"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"魏長官。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"二位，辛苦了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_6D5_1"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_6d5_wei"},{"type":"narration","text":"文月，龍門現任最高執政者，身份成謎。\n......聽說有一位盡心盡責的丈夫主持內務，不知真假。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmencommand"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然不想問責操勞一夜的同僚，但這份報告似乎比預計的要遲到了一些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪雉","speakerId":"char_383_snsant","isRemote":false,"text":"那是因、因為我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，整理報告耽誤了一些時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"以及，剛才發現22區的監控室裡有人在食用速食杯麵。順路斥責了他們一番。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"是我調度不力的責任，請魏長官指示。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯，我明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"先介紹一下這位可愛的新成員吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"這位是負責前進防線設施維護的高級工程師，工程代號雪雉，您應該知道她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪雉","speakerId":"char_383_snsant","isRemote":false,"text":"初初初次見面！請請請請叫我雪雉！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_6D5_1"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_6d5_snow"},{"type":"narration","text":"雪雉，龍門邊防工程部實習新人兼負責人。\n史上最快升職記錄保持者，雖然其本人對此完全沒有自信！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmencommand"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪雉","speakerId":"char_383_snsant","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，不，陳警官已經介紹過了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"我們也不是初次見面了，雪雉小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"士別三日當刮目相待，在哥倫比亞的歷練讓你成熟了很多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪雉","speakerId":"char_383_snsant","isRemote":false,"text":"您......您還記得？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼會不記得？你的才能和品德吸引了很多人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"更不用說你在離開龍門前有著令人印象深刻的表現。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪雉","speakerId":"char_383_snsant","isRemote":false,"text":"魏長官一直知道我的事情嗎......？我、我是不是做錯了什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"只是留心那些值得期待的年輕人罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪雉","speakerId":"char_383_snsant","isRemote":false,"text":"非非非常榮幸！可是我完全沒有前輩們能說會道，我以為不會有人注意到我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"很不巧，那些粉飾剽竊和利己目的的花言巧語我一個字都沒有聽。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"魏長官，打擾，我們收到了停泊申請的訊號，是合作方的艦船。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"——知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"雪雉，簡短一些，一會近衛局還要接待幾位客人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"今夜，將會是龍門最堅固的時刻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪雉","speakerId":"char_383_snsant","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，是！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lmstreet_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪雉","speakerId":"char_383_snsant","isRemote":false,"text":"呼啊，都這麼晚了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"本來可以早一點的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪雉","speakerId":"char_383_snsant","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚......很抱歉，回家之後我會多看幾遍手冊的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪雉","speakerId":"char_383_snsant","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係！明天陳警官再見到我的時候，我一定能準確畫出每層樓的結構示意圖！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......沒必要做到這個地步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"總之，從之後開始，你的專案將會需要直接向魏長官彙報。別太緊張了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪雉","speakerId":"char_383_snsant","isRemote":false,"text":"好，好的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪雉","speakerId":"char_383_snsant","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，那個......陳警官不回去休息嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"還有別的任務，近衛局如今抽不出更多人手，但的確有一些不管不行的傢伙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"以及，雖然還沒有公告給普通市民，但近衛局的確......發現了一些線索。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪雉","speakerId":"char_383_snsant","isRemote":false,"text":"辛、辛苦......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係，習以為常。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"這是你回到龍門的第一個新年，好好珍惜吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪雉","speakerId":"char_383_snsant","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯！謝謝！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_park"},{"type":"narration","text":"龍門公園"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鬼姐","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"乾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"眾人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"乾！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小弟","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"鬼姐，敬你一杯，來年也靠你了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小弟","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"多虧了鬼姐今年幫裡也是風調雨順！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小弟","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"鬼姐！我們什麼時候動身去廟街？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鬼姐","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"......啊，先別急，時間多得很——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鬼姐","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"但我還要等一位客人，她一定會來。讓人不爽的預感，我一早上眼皮都在跳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小弟","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊？客人？誰？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小弟","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你。你什麼時候！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"妨害公職，破壞公共財產，非法侵入，擾亂公共秩序，故意傷人。你們去年鬧得可真夠大的啊，“鬼姐”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鬼姐","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"那是他們自找的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"隨你說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鬼姐","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"陳sir是個大忙人，一定是忙糊塗了，去年的事今年才想起來。去，給陳sir倒杯酒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"省省吧，不用這麼麻煩，我知道你們要去做什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"但現在你們哪兒也別想去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鬼姐","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鬼姐","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"這就有點不講道理了吧，陳sir？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鬼姐","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"去年我們認栽，是因為我們有錯，現在我們什麼都沒做，就要被禁足了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"少貧了，去年你們那奇怪的慶典最後變成什麼樣，要我再提醒你們一遍嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"近衛局抽不出更多人手，我不會讓你們繼續惹麻煩的，沒和你開玩笑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鬼姐","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"那是你覺得我在開玩笑？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鬼姐","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"哎——唉。好吧，看在我們認識了這麼多年的份上，陳sir。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鬼姐","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"今年守年關的陣勢的確誇張得讓人頭皮發麻，我還以為烏薩斯人的大炮已經堵在臉上了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鬼姐","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"聽你的也行，按我們的規矩來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......可以。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"反正一開始我就是這麼打算的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鬼姐","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"但是要附加一個條件，如果我贏了，你要把近衛局到底發現了什麼告訴我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鬼姐","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"“今年情況特殊”......你說是吧，陳sir？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你要知道這個做什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鬼姐","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"總有人想知道的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，無妨，我奉陪到底。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鬼姐","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"等的就是你這句話！喂！拿酒來！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普通市民魏先生","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"隔壁好像有點吵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"退休老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"別管了。每年這個時候不都這樣，混混也要有混混的儀式感。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普通市民魏先生","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"你我還在當警察的時候，可不會讓他們這麼胡來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"退休老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"當然不會。我們連年獸都打退過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普通市民魏先生","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"你說亞音速源石巨蟲那一次？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"退休老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"我說地底軍團那一次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普通市民魏先生","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"那時候你還不是警察，我是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"退休老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"是這樣嗎？我記不得了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普通市民魏先生","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"......慢著，你剛才是不是動了棋盤？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"退休老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼會呢，我何時悔過棋？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普通市民魏先生","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"是，你從來不悔棋，都是趁我不注意直接偷天換日的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"退休老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"不會不會，哪裡哪裡，哈哈哈——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lmstreet_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"富家女","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"哼哼哼~♪哼哼~♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高材生","speakerId":"avg_npc_036","isRemote":false,"text":"你好像心情不錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"富家女","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"大過年的，幹嘛要心情不好？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高材生","speakerId":"avg_npc_036","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然你說的好像也對......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高材生","speakerId":"avg_npc_036","isRemote":false,"text":"有什麼好事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"富家女","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"你通過近衛局考核還不算好事嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"富家女","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"不過我一直以為你想進近衛局只是受你爸影響，沒想到你真的這麼積極啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高材生","speakerId":"avg_npc_036","isRemote":false,"text":"也有這個原因。主動挑起想做的事情，總好過任人擺佈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"富家女","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"真不像你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高材生","speakerId":"avg_npc_036","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣才好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高材生","speakerId":"avg_npc_036","isRemote":false,"text":"可你真的只因為我就會這麼高興嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"富家女","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"欸......不要說得這麼傷感情......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高材生","speakerId":"avg_npc_036","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，謝謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"富家女","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"坦率一點才對嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高材生","speakerId":"avg_npc_036","isRemote":false,"text":"我還以為是因為維多利亞的貨幣匯率下滑，你乘機做空得手，狠撈了一筆而暗爽來著，是我誤會你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"富家女","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"呃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高材生","speakerId":"avg_npc_036","isRemote":false,"text":"還是你在雷姆必拓投資的產業有了回報？我記得是礦業吧......而且轉手過程不太乾淨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"富家女","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"你、你怎麼知道得這麼詳細......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高材生","speakerId":"avg_npc_036","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？當然因為我們是朋友啊。詩。懷。雅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"富家女","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"我是真心的在問！真的！你真的沒有在私下調查我吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高材生","speakerId":"avg_npc_036","isRemote":false,"text":"我才不會這麼做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高材生","speakerId":"avg_npc_036","isRemote":false,"text":"......不過也許近衛局會很樂意能把你把控在手裡，算不算大功一件呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"富家女","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"別。千萬別。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"富家女","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧。不瞞你說，其實還有另一件讓人開心的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高材生","speakerId":"avg_npc_036","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，我們在這裡閒逛，還有聚會，她只能在近衛局盯著資料發呆，頂多藉口巡邏出來透個風，你當然很高興。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"富家女","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎麼又知道了！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高材生","speakerId":"avg_npc_036","isRemote":false,"text":"直覺，你以為我是靠什麼才在幾乎沒有準備的情況下完成刑偵科考試的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"富家女","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，不是，你真的沒有用什麼見不得光的資料賄賂近衛局吧......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高材生","speakerId":"avg_npc_036","isRemote":false,"text":"唔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"富家女","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，爆竹聲，這才有點年味嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"富家女","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？你幹嘛突然轉過身......啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高材生","speakerId":"avg_npc_036","isRemote":false,"text":"......幹嘛？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"富家女","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎麼還在怕爆竹？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高材生","speakerId":"avg_npc_036","isRemote":false,"text":"不。只是對於這種不可控的爆破物應用在日常生活中感到些許不安。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"富家女","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"爆破物？你說爆竹？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高材生","speakerId":"avg_npc_036","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯。現代爆竹不就是源石炸藥爆破物嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"富家女","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"是不是有點太小題大做了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高材生","speakerId":"avg_npc_036","isRemote":false,"text":"——我沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"富家女","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"......真的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高材生","speakerId":"avg_npc_036","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"富家女","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，那我正好想回顧一下兒時童趣，不如我們也去買一捆二踢腳——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高材生","speakerId":"avg_npc_036","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，我突然想起來，關於你的調查報告好像還放在抽屜裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"富家女","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"......我、我們還是趕緊去會場吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_uptown_3"},{"type":"narration","text":"通知：各單位注意，艦船停泊。各單位注意，艦船停泊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我們到了。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"這裡是龍門？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"感覺和印象裡不太一樣。","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"博士是第一次來到新年時的龍門吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然迎接新春的氛圍真的很吸引人，但我們畢竟是有任務在身的。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"來“守歲”是吧。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"說起來“年關”是啥？","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"“年”是一個傳說......很多人都是這麼認為的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"但根據記錄，是確有其事的奇異現象。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"每到年末交替的時節，龍門、乃至整個炎國，甚至是航線靠近這附近的烏薩斯部分國土都會遭到襲擊。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"襲擊？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"奇異現象？","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"今天真熱啊。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟各城邦有文字可考的損害記錄根本對不上號，而更早的傳說大多面目模糊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"有說是巨大的食人怪獸，有說是詭異的軍隊，也有說是幾名奇異的施術者......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"甚至有人篤定是某些犯罪組織或是別有用心的陰謀家，打著“年禍”、“災獸”之類的幌子進行犯罪活動......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......說起來，博士你開會沒聽嗎？"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"......抱歉。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島的各位，歡迎來到龍門。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"魏長官正在近衛局等待。請各位跟我來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"總之，我們先先去找魏長官吧，詳細的事項會由她來說明。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"不過......博士，你有看見炎熔嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_park"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鬼姐","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"這、這是第幾瓶了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小弟","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"鬼姐，要不算了吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鬼姐","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"數字！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小弟","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"十七！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鬼姐","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......你什麼時候，這麼能喝了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"在近衛局，總有一些應酬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鬼姐","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"你*龍門粗口*是在和什麼玩意應酬......可惡......嘔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鬼姐","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，好熱！喂，拿涼水來，啤酒也行！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小弟","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"鬼姐，你真的不能再喝了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"照顧好她，哪兒也別去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小弟","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唉，只好這樣了。鬼姐，水。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鬼姐","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"咕嘟——咕嘟——哈！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鬼姐","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"姓陳的，下次來拜年......嗝，能不能......不要找亂七八糟的藉口？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"身份有別。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"既然你認輸了，那我——唔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小弟","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——？陳Sir，我怎麼感覺你也有點晃？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"錯覺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......你們也要做好準備。萬一魏長官的猜測是真的，我們需要整個隆悶團街逸致——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小弟","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"陳sir，你真的還好吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"*深呼吸*嘶——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"等她醒了，告訴她，近衛局找到了“年”的線索。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小弟","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"線索？難不成是巨大的腳印嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"成因不明的巨大坑洞，被融化的廢棄建築，面積極大的焦痕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小弟","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊......我聽說年的真身其實是一條綿延萬里的源石蠕蟲......難道是真的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"鬼知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"儘管斥候沒有發現任何施術痕跡，但那些痕跡毫無疑問是最近留下的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"總之，如果真的有那個萬一......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你們也得幫忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小弟","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可我們為什麼要幫條子的忙？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"因為你們能打。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小弟","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......這話說的有點好聽哎！不愧是陳sir！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lmstreet_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"富家女","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"說真的，你不覺得今天很熱嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高材生","speakerId":"avg_npc_036","isRemote":false,"text":"開春早。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"富家女","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"不，可是這都大半夜了喔？這是開春的問題嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"富家女","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，無所謂啦！那隻龍回覆了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高材生","speakerId":"avg_npc_036","isRemote":false,"text":"......還沒。近衛局的通訊系統不是用來幹這種事的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"富家女","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"常規編制今天放假吧？沒事的啦，反正是我的私人頻道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"富家女","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"哼哼，說不定現在已經氣急敗壞得在下城區的小巷子裡駡街了呢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_park"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"退休老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"......老魏，是不是哪兒著火了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普通市民魏先生","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"大過年的你胡說什麼呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"退休老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"不，奇了怪，太陽都落山了怎麼還反倒升溫了呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"退休老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"說實話，我有點不好的預感。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普通市民魏先生","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"今年沒和女兒在一起心裡很不踏實吧，老來得子，疼愛有加。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"退休老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"你不懂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普通市民魏先生","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"早點投子認輸吧，別轉移話題了，你以為我會再給你動手腳的機會？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"退休老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"......嘖。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_rooftop_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"輕浮的近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，交班時間到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"認真的近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"報告整理好了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"輕浮的近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"早就好了，明天早上要是你先來記得幫我帶咖啡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"認真的近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"真是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"輕浮的近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"啊對了，這個給你，打發時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"認真的近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"這是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"認真的近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"......《年關軼事：多國災害史考據》？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"認真的近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"嘁，沒意思。年一定是個雲霧繚繞的神秘結社，怎麼還有人信怪獸學說的？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_motorroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_2014_nian","isRemote":false,"text":"搞什麼，找了我好久。現在的人都怎麼回事，這才多少年沒來就完全變了個樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_2014_nian","isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊，在這兒，我瞧瞧。嘖，搞出這麼多新的格式，完全沒有意義嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_2014_nian","isRemote":false,"text":"——整，合，運動？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_2014_nian","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......嗯......嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_2014_nian","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？就只有這些資訊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_2014_nian","isRemote":false,"text":"那我還不如直接發揮想像力......不，還是算了，怕他們受不了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_2014_nian","isRemote":false,"text":"好，我來琢磨琢磨......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪雉","speakerId":"char_383_snsant","isRemote":false,"text":"唔——嗯——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪雉","speakerId":"char_383_snsant","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣應該行了吧？啟動試試......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"實驗室用室溫校對系統","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——*電流聲*——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"實驗室用室溫校對系統","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"系統啟動成功。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"實驗室用室溫校對系統","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"實驗開機記錄已記錄。聲紋確認。所有人：雪雉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"實驗室用室溫校對系統","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"當前室溫14℃，邏輯判斷：室溫不正常。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪雉","speakerId":"char_383_snsant","isRemote":false,"text":"這次成功了......！嗚嗚，犧牲的電費總算有了回報......等等，不正常？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪雉","speakerId":"char_383_snsant","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚......我記得是有校對日誌的......在哪兒來著？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"實驗室用室溫校對系統","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"校對日誌篇目數：1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪雉","speakerId":"char_383_snsant","isRemote":false,"text":"是這個？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"實驗室用室溫校對系統","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"室溫判斷：明顯高於地區同期溫度。推測為實驗所致。檢索未發現熱源。檢索未發現源石反應。以上條目已錄入。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪雉","speakerId":"char_383_snsant","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......偵測源石反應的功能雖然是後加上去的，好像比想像中要靈敏很多......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪雉","speakerId":"char_383_snsant","isRemote":false,"text":"稍微擴大一下範圍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"實驗室用室溫校對系統","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"偵測範圍擴大失敗。原因：範圍內出現大量無反應對象，推測系統故障，排查中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪雉","speakerId":"char_383_snsant","isRemote":false,"text":"我想想......監視源石反應的技術本身是利用源石反應的波紋反饋，無反應對象就是說源石技藝完全無法探測的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪雉","speakerId":"char_383_snsant","isRemote":false,"text":"對源石反應絕緣？對源石完全絕緣的材料......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪雉","speakerId":"char_383_snsant","isRemote":false,"text":"......怎麼可能嘛！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪雉","speakerId":"char_383_snsant","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，那豈不是說真的出故障了......嗚......電費......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmencommand"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"以上就是委託的全部內容。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島在處理相關問題時向來表現出色，我很期待這次合作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝，魏長官。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_6D5_1"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_6d5_amiya"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿米婭，羅德島總負責人，儘管年紀尚輕，但也深得人心。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmencommand"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"（博士！還沒找到炎熔嗎？還沒有？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳。魏長官，那個......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"關於在龍門境內行動的幹員名單，可以在本人不在場的情況下登記嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"......是炎熔小姐嗎？"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"魏長官英明。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我是不是該吃驚一下？","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"ac6_3"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"炎熔小姐是災害專家，她對於古老的災難有著獨到的研究。這也是我們信任羅德島的重要原因。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，羅德島大部分幹員都有著出色的實力，我們理解。但炎熔小姐的手上有著年的——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"魏長官！抱歉打斷您的談話，緊急情況。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"請說。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"龍門市區內出現了無法識別的隊伍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"......帶著整合運動的標誌。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wild_a"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_2014_nian","isRemote":false,"text":"這個痕跡......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_2014_nian","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼說來，他們潛進了城裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_044_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，應該只有一個人，是他們中的某一個，和記載的一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_044_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......算了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"ac6_5"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_2014_nian","isRemote":false,"text":"無論這一次來的是誰，我都會阻止他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_2014_nian","isRemote":false,"text":"絕不會重蹈覆轍。絕不。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米婭"]},{"speakerId":"char_010_chen","aliases":["陳"]},{"speakerId":"char_015_lmg","aliases":["認真的近衛局成員","輕浮的近衛局成員","近衛局成員"]},{"speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","aliases":["鬼姐"]},{"speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","aliases":["普通市民魏先生"]},{"speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","aliases":["魏文月"]},{"speakerId":"char_2014_nian","aliases":["？？？"]},{"speakerId":"char_308_swire","aliases":["富家女"]},{"speakerId":"char_383_snsant","aliases":["？？？","雪雉"]}]}
